<h1 class="page-title">Feedra Prototype</h1>
<p class="standfirst"><span class="ph">[Your role] &middot; </span>Interactive prototype &middot; 2025 &middot; RMIT</p>

<p>Feedra is a prototype soundboard for running live sound, whether it's a game master's tabletop campaign or a stage show. Sounds are organised into campaigns and scenes, and each scene is a board of pads: big ones that loop (ambiences and music) and small ones for one-off effects, each with its own picture, volume, fades and effects. You build a scene's whole soundscape beforehand, then play it live.</p>
